THE SCHEDULE
Paragraph 2
Kampong Bugis DPWCS area
The Kampong Bugis DPWCS area comprises the area the boundary of which starts at Geylang Road at the Sir Arthur’s Bridge and continues progressively —
(a)generally west along Kallang Road until its junction with Crawford Street;
(b)generally south along Crawford Street until the Crawford Bridge; and
(c)generally follows the bank of the Rochor River and Kallang River until Sir Arthur’s Bridge along Geylang Road,
and which is more particularly demarcated in the map below, but excludes the following premises within the area:
(d)the Kallang Rivergreen Building;
(e)the Kallang Riverside Condominium;
(f)the Sri Manmatha Karuneshvarar Temple;
(g)The Riverine By The Park Condominium.
